Original content-title white? `.footer-smg` color white, content-title inherits white. Yes.

Logo card: `relative w-[200px] shrink-0 bg-white p-5` with img width 200 height 37 and orange bar right.
Original white strip; use card.

Columns sizes via flex: address w-[156px], legal w-[380px], contact w-[163px]. Use `lg:w-[16%]`, etc. Simpler grid: `grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr_1.5fr_1fr]`. Add back-to-top absolute right bottom? Original btn-top float right at same row. Use `ml-auto` link with up.svg 70x65. In grid add 5th column. On mobile center; top button at end.

Contact block: phones with phone icon, email with mailing icon, socials.

For FR/EN label: original footer label "CONTACTS" on EN home, "Contact" everywhere. We'll use "CONTACTS" for EN, "CONTACT" for FR? Use `locale==='fr' ? 'CONTACT' : 'CONTACTS'`. Fine.

Now home sections.

`Hero.tsx` server:
```tsx
export function HomeHero({content}) {
